Description: Local RGB Console for Femto Bolt and RealSense cameras
 Desktop and loopback web console with RGB, depth, IR, point clouds,
 local object detection, and a per-user SQLite capture archive.
 Run bolt-rgb-setup as your normal user before opening RGB Console.
 Built for Ubuntu 24.04 amd64 or arm64 with Python 3.12.
